  "findings": "Low runner-linked green rosettes with short opposite-bracted flower whorls, not one oversized terminal blue flower. Dedicated ajuga staged; cultivar yellow foliage excluded. Current seeds 1, 4 and 7 and every panel in the 36-seed contact sheet were visually inspected. Green runner rosettes support short opposite-bracted violet flowering stems. The 15\u201330 cm forms vary spread and height. Adjacent tiny whorls merge into violet columns at 25 mm; individual corolla detail is not resolved. Yellow-leaved cultivar color was explicitly excluded. Accepted as a coarse stylized spring source at 25 mm; user endorsement remains separate.",
